## Celltrion, Inc. financial statements, 6 years: Revenue grew at an average 17.62% a year

The consolidated financial statements in the 2020–2025 annual reports that Celltrion, Inc. (068270) filed with Korea's DART electronic disclosure system, laid out by year. Figures from the 2026 half-year report cover a different period and are shown separately. **Every figure below is taken as filed in the DART submissions; there is no interpretation or outlook.** Amounts are in Korean won (KRW; bn = billion, tn = trillion).

### 1. Income statement — the compound annual growth rate of revenue was 17.62%

| Fiscal year | Revenue | Revenue change | Operating income | Op. income change | Operating margin | Net income |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| 2020 | 1.85tn | — | 722.3bn | — | 39.1% | 525.7bn |
| 2021 | 1.89tn | +2.38% | 744.2bn | +3.02% | 39.3% | 595.8bn |
| 2022 | 2.28tn | +20.63% | 647.2bn | −13.03% | 28.3% | 542.6bn |
| 2023 | 2.18tn | −4.71% | 651.5bn | +0.66% | 29.9% | 539.7bn |
| 2024 | 3.56tn | +63.45% | 492.0bn | −24.48% | 13.8% | 418.9bn |
| 2025 | 4.16tn | +17.01% | 1.17tn | +137.49% | 28.1% | 1.03tn |

Revenue was largest in 2025 at KRW 4.16tn and smallest in 2020 at KRW 1.85tn among the six years. It fell from the previous year once: 2023 (−4.71%).

Operating income was largest in 2025 at KRW 1.17tn and smallest in 2024 at KRW 492.0bn. The operating margin was highest in 2021 at 39.3%.

**Net income was largest in 2025 at KRW 1.03tn and smallest in 2024 at KRW 418.9bn.**

### 2. Financial position — equity became 5.06x

| Fiscal year | Total assets | Total equity | Debt ratio | Current ratio |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 2020 | 5.02tn | 3.43tn | 46.5% | 238.1% |
| 2021 | 5.67tn | 4.05tn | 40.1% | 254.0% |
| 2022 | 5.89tn | 4.27tn | 37.8% | 226.4% |
| 2023 | 19.96tn | 17.13tn | 16.5% | 202.8% |
| 2024 | 21.06tn | 17.58tn | 19.8% | 175.2% |
| 2025 | 22.33tn | 17.35tn | 28.7% | 139.3% |

The debt ratio was highest in 2020 at 46.5% and lowest in 2023 at 16.5%.

Over the same period total assets went from KRW 5.02tn to KRW 22.33tn (4.45x), and **total equity went from KRW 3.43tn to KRW 17.35tn and became 5.06x.**

The current ratio was above 100% in all six years, ranging from 139.3% to 254.0%.

